  "title": "Pecan Cups",
  "description": "These miniature pecan cup pies are made in muffin tins. The filling is made with brown sugar, butter, egg, and pecans and spooned into cream cheese pastry-filled muffin cups.",
  "authors": [
    "Sharon"
  ],
